      "text": "$t1 == '190'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44386:44402"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44402:44404"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你竖起耳朵仔细听。一个枯槁的声音有气无力地回答道：“它在吃我！”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44404:44438"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你说什么？”拍摄者喊道。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44438:44453"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "那个枯槁、恐怖的声音尖叫着回答：“它在吃我！”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44453:44478"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "拍摄者又站在那里朝着黑暗盯了一会儿。然后，摄影机转向地面，朝着他穿着靴子的脚。他急匆匆地大步回到营地，爬进帐篷里。你听到远处的声音最后喊道：\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44478:44550"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“救救我！它们到处都是！我听不——”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44550:44570"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "影片结束了。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44570:44578"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次理智检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44578:44589"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 191。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44589:44605"
    },
    {
      "id": "190:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 194。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44605:44621"
    }
  ]
}
